<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 19206 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over four clock periods with four rows: clk, D, Q of a latch that is transparent while clk is high, and Q of a flip-flop. The phases where clk is high are shaded. D rises while clk is low, falls in the next high phase, shows a short pulse in the third high phase, and rises again in the following low phase. The latch output rises at the second rising edge, falls together with D, repeats the short pulse, and rises at the fourth rising edge. The flip-flop output changes only at the rising edges: high from the second, low from the third, and high from the fourth edge on.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 28468 0 R>>
endobj
